        "subject": "LU-20290 idl: Reserve OBD_CONNECT2_IRNID_REPLACE flag",
        "message": "LU-20290 idl: Reserve OBD_CONNECT2_IRNID_REPLACE flag\n\nReserve OBD_CONNECT2_IRNID_REPLACE flag value\n0x10000000000000ULL.\n\nThis allows targets to determine whether the connected MGS\nsupports NID list replacement during imperative recovery,\nwithout relying on MGS version numbers.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\n\nSigned-off-by: Serguei Smirnov <ssmirnov@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ide9b0c88f579d9681d8f0642f08c104134295459\n"
      },
